We have, $\begin{aligned} \text{ and } f(x)=\int_x^{x+1} e^{-t²} d t \Rightarrow f^{\prime}(x)=e^{-(x+1)^2}-e^{-x²} \\ \text{ and } f^{\prime}(x)=\frac{1}{e^{(x+1)^2}}-\frac{1}{e^{x^2}}
